# cli/lo/demo/program_pro.ocean
#
# The premium-tier program used for the cloud-replay tail. Same shape as
# program.ocean, with the open-core variants swapped for the proprietary
# ones (content fingerprint + tcd recursive loop). Requires LO_API_KEY in
# the environment; raises PremiumOperatorError otherwise.
#
# The audience sees this side-by-side with the local artifacts during the
# tail beat — the single-word swaps (`tf-idf` → `content fingerprint`,
# `kmeans` → `tcd recursive loop`) are the open-core split made visible.

seed 42

load corpus.ndjson take 500 records balanced by label label field is label
embed text into 128 dimensions using content fingerprint
cluster for 16 rounds max 24 modules energy = corpus mean crystallize every 4 using tcd recursive loop
align modules using 50 nearest records fine label field is label
find dispersion of each label
save to result.json
